  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the given circuit if the power rating of Zener diode is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo> </mo><mi>mW</mi></math>, the value of series resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></math> to regulate the input unregulated supply is:</p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b28eaad7-4dfa-4b5a-bcc0-7bb64182811c.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 173px;\"/>",
